iga-surface3d-extruded.out
3D IGA surface (bspline3dsurfaceelement): extruded curve against bsplineplanestrainsurfaceelement
StaticStructural nsteps 2 deltat 1.0 rtolv 1.e-12 maxiter 20 manrmsteps 1 nmodules 1
errorcheck
domain 3d
OutputManager tstep_all dofman_all element_all
ndofman 12 nelem 2 ncrosssect 1 nmat 1 nbc 3 nic 0 nltf 1 nset 3
# Nodes 1-4: control points of a plane strain B-spline curve (degree 2, two knot spans), dofs u, v.
# Nodes 5-12: the curve extruded to z = 0.8 as a B-spline surface of degrees 2 x 1 (rows z = 0 and z = 0.8,
# u index fastest). The first control points are fixed, the last ones moved by (0.25, 0.1) and the middle ones
# are free in x, y; w = 0 everywhere. The surface is then in plane strain: its free control points move as
# those of the curve, and the in-plane reactions of each row are L/2 = 0.4 times those of the curve.
node 1 coords 3 0.0 0.0 0.0 dofidmask 2 1 2
node 2 coords 3 0.3 0.5 0.0 dofidmask 2 1 2
node 3 coords 3 0.7 0.6 0.0 dofidmask 2 1 2
node 4 coords 3 1.0 0.0 0.0 dofidmask 2 1 2
node 5 coords 3 0.0 0.0 0.0
node 6 coords 3 0.3 0.5 0.0
node 7 coords 3 0.7 0.6 0.0
node 8 coords 3 1.0 0.0 0.0
node 9 coords 3 0.0 0.0 0.8
node 10 coords 3 0.3 0.5 0.8
node 11 coords 3 0.7 0.6 0.8
node 12 coords 3 1.0 0.0 0.8
bsplineplanestrainsurfaceelement 1 nodes 4 1 2 3 4 crosssect 1 knotvectoru 3 0 0.5 1 degree 1 2 nip 3 nlgeo 1
bspline3dsurfaceelement 2 nodes 8 5 6 7 8 9 10 11 12 crosssect 1 knotvectoru 3 0 0.5 1 knotvectorv 2 0 1 degree 2 2 1 nip 9 nlgeo 1
simplesurfacecs 1 material 1
surfacetensionmat 1 gamma1 0.3 alpha1 0.2 mu 1.0 lambda 0.5 d 1.0
BoundaryCondition 1 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 2 1 2 values 2 0.0 0.0 set 1
BoundaryCondition 2 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 2 1 2 values 2 0.25 0.1 set 2
BoundaryCondition 3 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 3 values 1 0.0 set 3
PiecewiseLinFunction 1 t 3 0.0 1.0 2.0 f(t) 3 0.0 0.5 1.0
Set 1 nodes 3 1 5 9
Set 2 nodes 3 4 8 12
Set 3 nodes 8 5 6 7 8 9 10 11 12
#
